                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Beaupré to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Buenos
                                Aires</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1906-03-12"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">March 12,
                    1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>President Quintana died this morning at 1.36.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Beaupré.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
